OK: joined: the link command line was computed
OK: joined: the path is absolute
OK: split: the link command line was computed
OK: split: the option is passed on its own
OK: split: the next value is the absolute path
OK: option_after: the link command line was computed
OK: option_after: the option without a path is passed as is
OK: option_after: the following option is not turned into a path
OK: option_after: the following option keeps its own absolute path
OK: repeated: the link command line was computed
OK: repeated: a run of options without a path is passed as is
OK: repeated: none of them is turned into a path
OK: repeated: the last one keeps its own absolute path
OK: dangling: the link command line was computed
